    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels like they deserve so much better than me. when i see them look at me with so much pride, it physically hurts because i know i'm just a lie. if i could just somehow fix it, or even just stop being the thing that's dragging them down... i just want the shame to stop. i feel like if i wasn't here, at least they wouldn't have to deal with the disappointment i bring every single day.",
